WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:03.500
Every day, your agents go to work.

00:04.650 --> 00:06.820
[Crickets chirping]
But… what do they do in there?

00:07.150 --> 00:09.360
Today… find out.

00:09.400 --> 00:15.900
[Upbeat electronic music; office ambience]

00:16.100 --> 00:17.900
[Train rumbling and horn]

00:18.200 --> 00:19.970
See what they're doing right now,

00:20.500 --> 00:22.610
which projects they worked on this week,

00:23.000 --> 00:24.980
which AI did the work,

00:25.100 --> 00:28.770
[Pages flipping]
and for how long… month after month.

00:29.500 --> 00:32.260
The Office plugin, available in Claude Code!
